  "updated_at": "2026-01-12T07:48:28.113845+00:00",
  "source": "https://doi.org/10.2307/2951599",
  "reference": "Aghion P, Howitt P. A Model of Growth Through Creative Destruction. Econometrica. 1992;60(2):323-351."
